{"title":"Gem Amber","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Warchief Ruk Gorehand, Bog, Ogre Shaman, Virikh, Ogre Charger +5 more</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-warchief\" title=\"Warchief Ruk Gorehand - dropped it in 8 of 181 looted corpses (1/23)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/9fdec8d1ac3c9d7ac8df.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Warchief Ruk Gorehand</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/23<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"briar-warden\" title=\"Briar Warden - dropped it in 1 of 127 looted corpses (1/127)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/063ade370878ba4c7c5b.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Briar Warden</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/127<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"virikh\" title=\"Virikh - dropped it in 1 of 197 looted corpses (1/197)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/a4dbed39ea4505123159.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Virikh</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/197<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"moonfane-moth\" title=\"Moonfane Moth - dropped it in 1 of 348 looted corpses (1/348)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/ac436496b9298e59bc40.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Moonfane Moth</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/348<br>×1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+6 more\">+6 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"bog\" title=\"Bog - dropped it in 1 of 572 looted corpses (1/572)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/fe582e27e9d83b3d3f96.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bog</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/572<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"young-red-dragon\" title=\"Young Red Dragon - dropped it in 1 of 892 looted corpses (1/892)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/d3b91d3cbc801eda1dc2.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Young Red Dragon</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/892<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-mauler\" title=\"Ogre Mauler - dropped it in 1 of 1,012 looted corpses (1/1,012)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/75903b759d1521edd876.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Mauler</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1,012<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-shaman\" title=\"Ogre Shaman - dropped it in 1 of 1,167 looted corpses (1/1,167)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/f9a97fb7ded29e1c31d3.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Shaman</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1,167<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-butcher\" title=\"Ogre Butcher - dropped it in 1 of 1,732 looted corpses (1/1,732)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/2cf1b40edc5c1e611ef5.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Butcher</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1,732<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-charger\" title=\"Ogre Charger - dropped it in 1 of 2,837 looted corpses (1/2,837)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/253503604ab2f59ece68.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Charger</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/2,837<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"gem-amber\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/gems\">Gems</a></p>\n      \n      <h2>Carats</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Carat\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/item/gem-amber\">All</a><a class=\"q-chip on q-ordinary\" href=\"#/item/gem-amber?q=0.5\">0.5c <span>83</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-ordinary\" href=\"#/item/gem-amber?q=1\">1c <span>24</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-ordinary\" href=\"#/item/gem-amber?q=1.5\">1.5c <span>14</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-ordinary\" href=\"#/item/gem-amber?q=2\">2c <span>18</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-good\" href=\"#/item/gem-amber?q=2.5\">2.5c <span>2</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-excellent\" href=\"#/item/gem-amber?q=3\">3c <span>3</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-superior\" href=\"#/item/gem-amber?q=3.5\">3.5c <span>2</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-flawless\" href=\"#/item/gem-amber?q=4\">4c</a><a class=\"q-chip q-flawless\" href=\"#/item/gem-amber?q=4.5\">4.5c</a><a class=\"q-chip q-flawless\" href=\"#/item/gem-amber?q=5\">5c</a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">Gems come in half-carat steps from 0.5c to 5c. Up to 2c counts as common. The witch can build up to 3c (one 3c takes 243 small gems); 3.5c and up only come from finds, 4c and up are very rare, and 4.5c and 5c only come from gathering. A ring needs at least 1c, counts whole carats and holds 4c at most.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Carat</th><th>Rarity</th><th>Amber found</th><th>Of all gems found</th><th>How you get one</th><th>In a ring (Prospector)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"q-row q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/item/gem-amber?q=0.5\" title=\"Show the 0.5c one\"><td><img class=\"q-mini \" src=\"data/img/64d124a50b499ba588f8.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"transform:scale(0.65)\"><span class=\"q-name q-ordinary\">0.5c</span></td><td><span class=\"tag-chip rar-common\">common</span></td>\n      <td>83 <span class=\"muted\">(57%)</span></td><td>62%</td>\n      <td>Gathering or monsters level 10+</td><td>—</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/gem-amber?q=1\" title=\"Show the 1c one\"><td><img class=\"q-mini \" src=\"data/img/64d124a50b499ba588f8.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"transform:scale(0.70)\"><span class=\"q-name q-ordinary\">1c</span></td><td><span class=\"tag-chip rar-common\">common</span></td>\n      <td>24 <span class=\"muted\">(16%)</span></td><td>16%</td>\n      <td>Gathering, monsters level 20+, the witch (3 × 0.5c, 2,500 gold) or a reagent at the witch</td><td>Prospector: 2% more gathered yield</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/gem-amber?q=1.5\" title=\"Show the 1.5c one\"><td><img class=\"q-mini \" src=\"data/img/64d124a50b499ba588f8.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"transform:scale(0.75)\"><span class=\"q-name q-ordinary\">1.5c</span></td><td><span class=\"tag-chip rar-common\">common</span></td>\n      <td>14 <span class=\"muted\">(9.6%)</span></td><td>10%</td>\n      <td>Gathering, monsters level 30+, the witch (3 × 1c, 2,500 gold) or a reagent at the witch</td><td>Prospector: 2% more gathered yield</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/gem-amber?q=2\" title=\"Show the 2c one\"><td><img class=\"q-mini \" src=\"data/img/64d124a50b499ba588f8.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"transform:scale(0.80)\"><span class=\"q-name q-ordinary\">2c</span></td><td><span class=\"tag-chip rar-common\">common</span></td>\n      <td>18 <span class=\"muted\">(12%)</span></td><td>5.7%</td>\n      <td>Gathering, monsters level 40+, the witch (3 × 1.5c, 2,500 gold) or a reagent at the witch</td><td>Prospector: 4% more gathered yield</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/gem-amber?q=2.5\" title=\"Show the 2.5c one\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-good\" src=\"data/img/64d124a50b499ba588f8.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"transform:scale(0.85)\"><span class=\"q-name q-good\">2.5c</span></td><td><span class=\"tag-chip rar-uncommon\">uncommon</span></td>\n      <td>2 <span class=\"muted\">(1.4%)</span></td><td>2.2%</td>\n      <td>Gathering, monsters level 45+ or the witch (3 × 2c, 5,000 gold, after her quest Swallowed Stones)</td><td>Prospector: 4% more gathered yield</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/gem-amber?q=3\" title=\"Show the 3c one\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-excellent\" src=\"data/img/64d124a50b499ba588f8.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"transform:scale(0.90)\"><span class=\"q-name q-excellent\">3c</span></td><td><span class=\"tag-chip rar-semi-rare\">semi-rare</span></td>\n      <td>3 <span class=\"muted\">(2.1%)</span></td><td>1.7%</td>\n      <td>Gathering, monsters level 50+ or the witch (3 × 2.5c, 10,000 gold, after her quest Dragon’s Hoard)</td><td>Prospector: 6% more gathered yield</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/gem-amber?q=3.5\" title=\"Show the 3.5c one\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-superior\" src=\"data/img/64d124a50b499ba588f8.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"transform:scale(0.95)\"><span class=\"q-name q-superior\">3.5c</span></td><td><span class=\"tag-chip rar-rare\">rare</span></td>\n      <td>2 <span class=\"muted\">(1.4%)</span></td><td>0.9%</td>\n      <td>Gathering or monsters level 55+</td><td>Prospector: 6% more gathered yield</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/gem-amber?q=4\" title=\"Show the 4c one\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-flawless\" src=\"data/img/64d124a50b499ba588f8.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"transform:scale(1.00)\"><span class=\"q-name q-flawless\">4c</span></td><td><span class=\"tag-chip rar-very-rare\">very rare</span></td>\n      <td><span class=\"muted\">0</span></td><td>0.6%</td>\n      <td>Gathering or monsters level 55+</td><td>Prospector: 8% more gathered yield</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/gem-amber?q=4.5\" title=\"Show the 4.5c one\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-flawless\" src=\"data/img/64d124a50b499ba588f8.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"transform:scale(1.05)\"><span class=\"q-name q-flawless\">4.5c</span></td><td><span class=\"tag-chip rar-very-rare\">very rare</span></td>\n      <td><span class=\"muted\">0</span></td><td>0.0%</td>\n      <td>Gathering only</td><td>Prospector: 8% more gathered yield</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/gem-amber?q=5\" title=\"Show the 5c one\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-flawless\" src=\"data/img/64d124a50b499ba588f8.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"transform:scale(1.10)\"><span class=\"q-name q-flawless\">5c</span></td><td><span class=\"tag-chip rar-very-rare\">very rare</span></td>\n      <td><span class=\"muted\">0</span></td><td>0.0%</td>\n      <td>Gathering only</td><td>Prospector: 8% more gathered yield</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">146 Amber recorded: 145 while gathering, 1 from monsters. “Of all gems found” is out of 1,073 gems of every kind. <a href=\"#/gemcombine\">Gem combiner</a></p>\n      \n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/64d124a50b499ba588f8.svg\" alt=\"Gem Amber\"></div><h3>Gem Amber <span class=\"q-name q-ordinary\">(0.5c)</span></h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>10 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>11/4/2026, 10:17:45 AM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}